pipeline parameters (fold count, backbone size) is needed to isolate whether a score gap is due to single-component variance or a systematic pipeline bug.\n      - **Parameterize and separate model pipelines** `T.8.3.1`\n      - **Verify a cleanup or inference-only refactor** `T.8.3.2`\n      - **Pin configurations and artifacts** `T.8.3.3`\n      - **Make missing-component behavior explicit** `T.8.3.4`","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
